zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTlUUaf-wPIAHPC3LpaJ0QcMdu9zL_L4X_8E-Eb4QspqA&oe=6B05BE09"}, {"file_name": "Unbenannt-2 (1).png", "id": "1065112948588367", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035426_1065112955255033_6685537883324586242_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ac-sd2E3nukQ7kNvwHktnCl&_nc_oc=AdoGYOqVEDYjnAnYnwKAiEJsvVIg5YTSrJeEABFuV-sD8nUuZeYX289LHOpfeVIdVSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTa4hSMdUcmcFWdogqMy4O6Jb4j2TFXT8W7L418td2XQw&oe=6B05C959"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Shopkeeper Simulator VR: Refreshed", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Shopkeeper Simulator VR is the original trading game for VR, now also available for the Meta Quest! You have to run a grocery store, restock goods, and earn money from selling food. Unlock helpful equipment to make your workday easier.\n\nExperience the Refreshed! version on your wireless Quest in a revamped visual environment!\n\n**Features**\n\n- Various types of food: From broccoli to meat to cheese!\n- Unlock equipment for better efficiency: Store products in your fridge to keep them fresh; be notified of new customers by a doorbell, and store your money bundles in the safe!\n- 3 difficulty levels\n- Dollhouse mode for smaller players.", "short_description": "Be your own boss at the supermarket! Serve customers, buy goods, and maximize your profit to be able to pay the rent for the next day!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "hero.png", "id": "8349211358474029", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031574_8349211371807361_1227774605904861488_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nIDnNht44B8Q7kNvwHAHCkO&_nc_oc=AdrOisXgJaMTjdaJHm3DNj4lfheKt8Ju188AoV8Ygt63hrPEaWC7dELJ5zUpKDFqdQc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_